WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.675
Get unstuck. There is a guide.

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:11.353
Barforge Weightlifting has a Help center. It has short guides, one task each. They are free to read, and written step by step.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:17.326
Use search. Type a word, like export. You land on the exact section.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:22.968
Open a guide and follow the steps. Check the weight and reps. Tap Made or Miss.

00:00:23.433 --> 00:00:28.170
Then do it in the app. Log a set, and the rest timer starts.

00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:32.952
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
